# Cloudflare Pages response headers. https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
# X-Robots-Tag keeps the review preview out of search (covers images too, unlike the meta tag).
# Remove it when this becomes the live autismga.org site.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
